  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rG3fvJP/Lucky-Blocks-Race.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1129\" height=\"95\"></strong></span></h2><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f90\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VD7f4Pn/A-simple-race-along-with-a-Pv-P-at-the-end.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1129\" height=\"33\"></span></h2><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>資訊公告！</strong></em></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>此地圖支援2至8名玩家！</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一張有趣的地圖，你的<strong>運氣</strong>將決定你的<strong>成敗！</strong> </span><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">和你的朋友<strong>競爭</strong>，看看誰是<strong>最幸運的人！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><br></span>在這張地圖中，你會看到一條充滿<strong>幸運方塊</strong>的賽道，<strong>藍色玩家</strong>必須先開始遊戲</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>藍色玩家必須開始遊戲</strong>，抵達終點後</span><span>你會找到一個基地來武裝自己，然後進入<strong>PVP！</strong> </span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">最後<strong>存活下來的玩家</strong>將<strong>獲勝！</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">內含<strong>重生點</strong>，讓你不會感到沮喪！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 此地圖專為<strong>1.16.5版本</strong>設計</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 此地圖中僅有經典的<strong>幸運方塊</strong>。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">地圖圖片</span></em></span><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/768/2022-07-25_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"269\"></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4YQSMmq/This-map-requiere-mod.png\" width=\"1507\" height=\"70\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模組版本：</strong> Lucky Block Forge/Fabric 1.16.5-8.0 或更高版本</span><br><em><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block</a></span></strong></em></h3><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">按此領取25%折扣</span><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e786a9cc-b379-4f61-b906-ed81aeb57024.png\" width=\"1351\" height=\"224\"></a></h2><hr><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>作者：</strong></em></h6><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>El_this_boy</strong><br>- <strong>Twitch</strong>：<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/el_this_boy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.twitch.tv/el_this_boy</a><br>- <strong>Twitter</strong>：<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Elthisboy2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://twitter.com/Elthisboy2</a><br>- <strong>Instagram</strong>：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252finstagram.com%252fel_this_boy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://instagram.com/el_this_boy</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">協作者：</span><br></strong><br>- Anto_niapaz &lt;3</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>- Oreozukiztrukiz2&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>- felix__owo</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>- juan__458</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>- Matiskyper</em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">-maartina<br